# ArduPlane Parameter Overrides - Staircase LiDAR Mission
# Base files: plane_base.parm + plane_lidar.parm
# Purpose:    Tight navigation for accurate LiDAR overpass of 20 m wide platforms
#
# Changes from plane_params.parm:
#   NAVL1_PERIOD  17 → 13   L1 lookahead 76m → 58m. Tighter tracking without oscillation.
#                            Period=10 was too aggressive (caused oscillation/weaving).
#   NAVL1_DAMPING 0.75→0.85 More damping to prevent hunting at tighter period.
#   WP_RADIUS     20 → 10   Exactly the platform half-width (20m/2). Forces the aircraft
#                            to actually fly over the platform before capturing the WP.
#   SIM_WIND_SPD   5 → 0    No wind — eliminate lateral drift for clean LiDAR data.
#   SIM_WIND_TURB 0.5→ 0    No turbulence — no random heading perturbations.
#   SIM_WIND_DIR 180 → 0    Irrelevant at SPD=0, set to 0 for clarity.

# ============ NAVIGATION TUNING ============
# L1 lookahead = NAVL1_PERIOD × airspeed / π = 13 × 14 / 3.14 ≈ 58m
# Corrects cross-track error within ~1 segment length (100m between platforms)
NAVL1_PERIOD     13
NAVL1_DAMPING    0.85
WP_RADIUS        10

# ============ WIND SIMULATION (SITL) ============
SIM_WIND_SPD     0
SIM_WIND_TURB    0
SIM_WIND_DIR     0
